{"sectionId":"biomol/protein","items":[{"id":"biomol--protein-k001","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"표준 아미노산은 α탄소에 아미노기, 카복실기, 수소와 R기를 갖는다(글라이신은 R=H).","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k002","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"산성 곁사슬은 Asp, Glu, 염기성은 Lys, Arg, His이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k003","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"Cys는 산화되어 이황화결합을 형성하고 Pro는 고리 구조로 주사슬의 회전을 제한한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k004","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"방향족에는 Phe, Tyr, Trp가 포함된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k005","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"펩타이드 결합은 공명 때문에 부분 이중결합 성격을 띠며 대체로 평면이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k006","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"1차 구조는 서열, 2차 구조는 주사슬 수소결합에 의한 α나선·β병풍, 3차 구조는 단일 폴리펩타이드의 입체구조, 4차 구조는 여러 소단위의 조립이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k007","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"변성은 주로 고차 구조를 파괴하며 일반적인 변성에서 펩타이드 결합은 유지된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k008","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"샤페론은 접힘을 돕지만 단백질 구조의 기본 정보는 서열에 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k009","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"아미노산의 순전하는 각 이온화기의 pKa와 pH에 의존한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k010","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"낮은 pH에서 양성자화, 높은 pH에서 탈양성자화가 유리하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k011","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"등전점 pI는 평균 순전하가 0인 pH다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k012","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"단순 아미노산에서는 순전하 0 종을 둘러싼 두 pKa의 평균으로 구한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k013","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"pH<pI이면 평균 순전하 양, pH>pI이면 음.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k014","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"글루탐산은 산성 곁사슬, 리신은 염기성 곁사슬을 갖는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k015","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"히스티딘의 이미다졸기는 생리 pH 부근에서 양성자 전달에 관여할 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"biomol--protein-k016","sectionId":"biomol/protein","unitId":"biomol","subject":"biology","text":"순전하 0 종을 둘러싸는 2.2와 4.3의 평균인 약 3.25이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}